		"sections": [
			{
				"id": 30480,
				"title": "Overview",
				"body_text": "Geezle siphons massive power from the generator during [Turbo Charge], causing the Waterworks to destabilize and collapse. \r\n\r\nGeezle then fries his enemies with an array of voltaic attacks as [Leaping Sparks] pursue players to their electrocution in the depths of the dam.",
				"sections": [
					{
						"id": 31955,
						"title": "Tanks",
						"body_text": "$bullet;[Thunder Punch] inflicts massive damage and knocks the target back.\r\n$bullet;[Dam Water] electrifies upon contact with Geezle's lightning abilities.\r\n$bullet;[Leaping Sparks] pursue players and stun them upon contact."
					},
